Server Configuration

PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development

Database Configuration

Replace the URI below with your MongoDB Atlas connection string when you are ready to go live.

For local development, this default URI will connect to a local MongoDB instance.

MONGO_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/learning_hub

Authentication

Change this to a random, secure string in a real production environment

JWT_SECRET=super_secret_learning_hub_key_12345
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d